# Hindsight Memory

For non-trivial Rosey work, use [`rosey-hindsight`](../skills/rosey-hindsight/SKILL.md) as the source of truth for local memory.

- At the start of planning, implementation, or diff review, recall relevant context with `uvx hindsight-embed memory recall`.
- During work, retain durable discoveries, user preferences, procedure outcomes, and project conventions with `uvx hindsight-embed memory retain`.
- At the end of implementation work, retain a concise session summary with changed files, verification, blockers, and decisions.
- If Hindsight is unavailable or not configured, continue the Rosey workflow and record the unavailable status where applicable.
- Do not store secrets or sensitive data.
